      "reason": "bindHumanSelection calls validateRequestClosed(request) before checkAcyclicAndSafe(request). The schema validator reads allowed request fields directly without rejecting accessor descriptors, so an allowed-field getter can execute before the later safety scan rejects the request. buildRecommendation also calls validateRequestClosed without a safety preflight.",
